@baseUrl = http://localhost:5163
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### Login Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Create New Admin (requires token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "username": "newadmin",
  "email": "newadmin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get Admin by Username (requires token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test Protected Customers Endpoint (requires token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test Protected Reservations Endpoint (requires token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test Public Books Endpoint (no token required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books
